                <UserObject label="" tooltip="This flow object is intended to split money between different flow objects, it can do so via one or more splitter rules. The rules execute in-order meaning once one rule is finished, it passes what remains of its total to the next rule until there is no more money left. See the &#39;RuleSet&#39; entity for an example.&#xa;&#xa;The &#39;type&#39; field is an enumeration with the following possible values:&#xa;&#xa;  0 -&gt; NONE (Results in Error)&#xa;  1 -&gt; Static - the values specified are static, hard dollar amounts taken out.&#xa;  2 -&gt; Percentage - The values specified are a percentage of the total (0%-100%)&#xa;&#xa;The &quot;values&quot; referenced are those in the rule pair table" id="80">
                    <mxCell style="shape=table;startSize=0;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                        <mxGeometry x="640" y="420" width="210" height="100" as="geometry"/>
                    </mxCell>
